# Toby's Beast token has "This token can't attack or block alone" (CR 508.1c): the token alone is not a legal declaration of
# attackers, and with Toby attacking too it is. Toby is the 1/1 and the Beast the 4/4, so the declaration deals five damage.

[Bot1 Deck]
Black Lotus
Toby, Beastie Befriender
Plains x18

[Bot2 Deck]
Island x20

[Actions]
Bot1.Hand.Black Lotus.Cast
Bot1.Hand.Toby, Beastie Befriender.Cast
Bot1.Battlefield.Black Lotus.Activate(Color: White)
Bot1.Pass
Bot2.Pass
Bot1.Pass
Bot2.Pass
? Bot1.Battlefield.Beast Token.Tapped = false
[T3 Bot1.Main1]
Bot1.Pass
Bot2.Pass
! Bot1.Attack(Beast Token > Bot2; Alone: yes)
Bot1.Attack(Beast Token > Bot2; Toby, Beastie Befriender > Bot2)
Bot1.Pass
Bot2.Pass
Bot1.Pass
Bot2.Pass

[Expect]
Bot1.Battlefield.Beast Token.Tapped = true
Bot2.Life = 15
